  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Four Xunzi notice that Fang Yuan was disguised as the immemorial year monkey. He had modified familiar face. He relies on the immemorial year monkey’s tough physique to punch Present and Past Pavilion. He originally had over seventy thousand time path dao marks. His transformation path dao marks turn into time path dao marks and add another fifty thousand, so he has over a hundred and twenty thousand time path dao marks. He does not need winter coat. The monkey body endures their attacks. He jumps above Present and Past Pavilion and stomps with huge immemorial year monkey feet. The pavilion breaks apart.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_xunzi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "house_present_and_past_pavilion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan uses familiar face to turn into the immemorial year monkey again. The three Xunzi say winter coat has fused with his immemorial year monkey transformation. His monkey fur is like frost and his skin is like ice, and his defenses are extremely thick.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "frosted-fur",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal killer move Immemorial Year Monkey Transformation is named. Fang Yuan transforms again. All of his dao marks turn into one million and five hundred thousand time path dao marks. He drives Myriad Year Flying Warship at full force and it shoots out.",
